There are a precious few Ascention Kit(tm) items you just can't do
without.

MR of some kind, Reflection and a Ring of Free Action

Pretty much everything else is either very easy to come by,
substitutable, or only increases your comfort zone.

MR's needed to survive the Finger, among other things.  Reflection to
survive the death rays / disentigration breath attacks (though I guess
with the intrinsics you could do this naked).  And Free Action to
survive Priest Paralysis attacks.  I guess you could have MUCHO
hitpoints and gamble it, but that seems a poor substitute for the
non-extincionist player.

So while there are lots of MR sources (CoMR, MagicBane, Quest
Artifacts, and Grey Dragons) and there are lots of Relfection sources
(Amulet, Silver Dragons, and The Bow of Diana) there is only one
source of Free Action.

And if the RGN hasn't statistically given it to you you'll need to
break conduct to get this necessary item and wish for it or poly-pile.
